{"id":"wb-1-97","name":"观星台","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"登封观星台","text":"登封观星台，也称为告成天文台，最早是周公建造的观星台，位于中华人民共和国河南省登封，邻近告成，是世界遗产之一。这个观星台有悠久的历史，从西周开始到元朝的初期。元朝的天文学家郭守敬在1276年将它重建成一个巨大的天文台，是中国现存最早的古代天文台。附近还有建于唐朝开元十一年（723年）的周公测景台。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%99%BB%E5%B0%81%E8%A7%82%E6%98%9F%E5%8F%B0","revisionId":93060051,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93060051","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c8c239a0b6169eedd82715bd.jpg","title":"20250608_Gaocheng_Observatory_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250608_Gaocheng_Observatory_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a5/20250608_Gaocheng_Observatory_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​登封观星台","width":320,"height":213}}